PN,41902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F419A1784303294
OL,3,CChild hit by bottle and nine police
OL,4,Cofficers injured before football match
OL,6,FA number of Cliftonville supporters
OL,7,Fhad taken part in a parade ahead of
OL,8,Fthe clash, which Swifts won on
OL,9,Fpenalties after a 1-1 draw.
OL,11,FThe Irish Football Association
OL,12,Fcondemed the disorder.
OL,14,FSouth Belfast district commander
OL,15,FSuperintendent Finola Dornan said
OL,16,Fduring the procession "provocative
OL,17,Fconduct" and "heavy use of
OL,18,Fpyrotechnics and fireworks" was
OL,19,Fobserved.
OL,26,@xD@WOUyD@HO]yD@NOUzD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,420,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F419A1784303294
OL,3,CChild hit by bottle and nine police
OL,4,Cofficers injured before football match
OL,6,FShe said a 19-year-old was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of riotous behaviour and two
OL,8,Fwere reported for offences including
OL,9,Fthe use of flares.
OL,11,F"While the majority of football fans
OL,12,Fattending Friday evening's match
OL,13,Fbehaved in a peaceful manner, a number
OL,14,Fof people chose to engage in
OL,15,Fdisorderly behaviour and provocative
OL,16,Fconduct," she said.
OL,26,@sD@AOUxD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,420,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F419A1784303294
OL,3,CChild hit by bottle and nine police
OL,4,Cofficers injured before football match
OL,6,F"During an approved public procession
OL,7,Fahead of the match, which involved
OL,8,Fapproximately 250 people, our officers
OL,9,Fwitnessed provocative conduct and the
OL,10,Fheavy use of pyrotechnics and
OL,11,Ffireworks ` despite various warnings
OL,12,Fbeing issued against this."
OL,14,FShe said there appeared to be a number
OL,15,Fof potential breaches of the Parades
OL,16,FCommission determinations in relation
OL,17,Fto the procession which will be
OL,18,Finvestigated.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,420,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F419A1784303294
OL,3,CChild hit by bottle and nine police
OL,4,Cofficers injured before football match
OL,6,F"A 19-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of riotous behaviour, doing
OL,8,Fa provocative act, possession of
OL,9,Ffireworks/flares at a regulated match,
OL,10,Findecent behaviour and attempted
OL,11,Fcriminal damage. He remains in police
OL,12,Fcustody at this time," she said.
OL,14,F"Two other people were also reported
OL,15,Ffor offences including the use of
OL,16,Fflares."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@VO]vD@AOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,420,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F419A1784303294
OL,3,CChild hit by bottle and nine police
OL,4,Cofficers injured before football match
OL,6,FShe added: "The vast majority of fans
OL,7,Fwere there to enjoy the match, however
OL,8,Fthere was completely unacceptable
OL,9,Fbehaviour from a proportion of fans
OL,10,Fboth before and after the match, at
OL,11,Fwhat should have been an enjoyable and
OL,12,Fsafe event for all attending.
OL,14,F"Police will not tolerate disorder or
OL,15,Fcriminal behaviour of any kind and, as
OL,16,Falways, we will continue to work with
OL,17,Ffootball clubs to address any
OL,18,Finappropriate behaviour linked to
OL,19,Fpeople attending matches and ensure
OL,20,Fthat the local community is kept safe.
OL,26,@nD@LOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNI Sport  CReg Radio FRewind
FL,420,440,250,120,000,100
PN,41907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F419A1784303294
OL,3,CChild hit by bottle and nine police
OL,4,Cofficers injured before football match
OL,6,F"We will therefore be conducting a
OL,7,Fthorough evidence-gathering operation
OL,8,Fin the wake of last night's
OL,9,Foccurrences."
OL,11,FIn a statement to UTV, a spokesperson
OL,12,Ffrom the Irish Football Association
OL,13,F(IFA) said: "We are aware of incidents
OL,14,Fat last night's match and condemn
OL,15,Fthose involved in any disorder.
OL,17,F"Whilst we are responsible for matters
OL,18,Finside the stadium, the Police Service
OL,19,Fof Northern Ireland have jurisdiction
OL,20,Foutside of it," they said.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@MO]uD@MOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/8
